  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Uniban TSCF Loan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The transaction consists in a Revolving Committed Credit line in the amount of US$15 million for financing accounts receivable from banana and other fruit exports to selected buyers from Tropical Marketing Associated (TMA), commercial branch and subsidiary of C.I. Uni&#xf3;n de Bananeros de Urab&#xe1;, main banana and plantain exporter in Colombia. The transaction goal is to strengthen the working capital terms of TMA and to support the growth of banana and other fruit exports to Europe from Colombian SME farmers. Additionally, it includes an uncommitted tranche of up to US$10 million for new investments in Colombia for 2022 and/or 2023.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The transaction consists in a Revolving Committed Credit line in the amount of US$15 million for financing accounts receivable from banana and other fruit exports to selected buyers from Tropical Marketing Associated (TMA), commercial branch and subsidiary of C.I. Uni&#xf3;n de Bananeros de Urab&#xe1;, main banana and plantain exporter in Colombia. The transaction goal is to strengthen the working capital terms of TMA and to support the growth of banana and other fruit exports to Europe from Colombian SME farmers. Additionally, it includes an uncommitted tranche of up to US$10 million for new investments in Colombia for 2022 and/or 2023.</narrative>
